{"seq":2,"slug":"spa-dynamic-content-a11y","title":"SPA 与动态内容无障碍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/advanced/spa-dynamic-content-a11y","wordCount":993,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"spa-与动态内容无障碍\">SPA 与动态内容无障碍</h1><p>单页应用（SPA）通过客户端路由和动态 DOM 更新提供流畅的用户体验，但这些特性恰恰破坏了辅助技术依赖的传统页面加载模型。传统多页应用中，每次导航都触发页面完整加载——屏幕阅读器自动朗读新页面标题、焦点重置到页面顶部。SPA 的客户端路由不触发页面加载事件，DOM 变化对辅助技术而言是「静默」的，除非开发者主动通知。2026 年主流前端框架（React/Vue/Angular/Svelte）均未内置完整的路由无障碍方案——这仍然是工程师需要手动处理的领域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SPA 无障碍的三大挑战与对应策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SPA 无障碍挑战] --&gt; B[路由变化不播报]&#10;    A --&gt; C[动态内容不感知]&#10;    A --&gt; D[焦点管理断裂]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;策略: aria-live 路由公告&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;策略: document.title 同步&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[&quot;策略: 焦点移动到新内容&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;策略: aria-live regions&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;策略: role=status/alert&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;策略: aria-busy 加载态&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;策略: 焦点恢复 trigger element&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;策略: 虚拟滚动焦点保持&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[&quot;策略: 懒加载后焦点位置&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[SPA 无障碍挑战] --&gt; B[路由变化不播报]\n    A --&gt; C[动态内容不感知]\n    A --&gt; D[焦点管理断裂]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"策略: aria-live 路由公告\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"策略: document.title 同步\"]\n    B --&gt; B3[\"策略: 焦点移动到新内容\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"策略: aria-live regions\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"策略: role=status/alert\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"策略: aria-busy 加载态\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"策略: 焦点恢复 trigger element\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"策略: 虚拟滚动焦点保持\"]\n    D --&gt; D3[\"策略: 懒加载后焦点位置\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SPA 场景</th>\n<th>传统页面行为</th>\n<th>SPA 默认行为</th>\n<th>无障碍修复方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路由切换</td>\n<td>新页面加载，朗读 title，焦点重置</td>\n<td>DOM 局部更新，无朗读，焦点不动</td>\n<td>主动公告 + 焦点管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表加载</td>\n<td>新页面渲染完整列表</td>\n<td>动态追加 DOM 节点</td>\n<td>aria-live 播报结果数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表单提交</td>\n<td>页面刷新显示结果</td>\n<td>异步返回，DOM 更新</td>\n<td>role=alert 通知结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无限滚动</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>动态追加内容</td>\n<td>焦点保持 + 加载状态播报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>骨架屏/加载</td>\n<td>浏览器 loading 指示</td>\n<td>自定义 skeleton</td>\n<td>aria-busy + 完成播报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"路由变化的无障碍公告\">路由变化的无障碍公告</h2><p>SPA 路由切换后，屏幕阅读器用户无法感知页面已变化。解决方案是主动「公告」新页面：</p>\n<p><strong>方案一：aria-live 路由公告器（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 在 DOM 根部放置一个视觉隐藏的公告区域 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div id=&quot;route-announcer&quot; aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;sr-only&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 在 DOM 根部放置一个视觉隐藏的公告区域 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route-announcer\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"assertive\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-atomic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sr-only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function announceRouteChange(pageTitle: string) {&#10;  const announcer = document.getElementById(&#39;route-announcer&#39;);&#10;  if (announcer) {&#10;    announcer.textContent = &#39;&#39;;&#10;    requestAnimationFrame(() =&gt; {&#10;      announcer.textContent = `已导航到：${pageTitle}`;&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// React Router 集成示例&#10;function RouteAnnouncer() {&#10;  const location = useLocation();&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const pageTitle = document.title;&#10;    announceRouteChange(pageTitle);&#10;  }, [location.pathname]);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div id=&quot;route-announcer&quot; aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;&#10;         className=&quot;sr-only&quot; /&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> announceRouteChange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pageTitle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> announcer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'route-announcer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (announcer) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    announcer.textContent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      announcer.textContent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `已导航到：${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pageTitle</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// React Router 集成示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RouteAnnouncer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useLocation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pageTitle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.title;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    announceRouteChange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pageTitle);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }, [location.pathname]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route-announcer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aria</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">live</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"assertive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aria</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">atomic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         className</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sr-only\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>方案二：焦点移动到页面标题</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function handleRouteChange() {&#10;  document.title = `新页面标题 - 网站名`;&#10;&#10;  // 将焦点移动到 h1，屏幕阅读器自动朗读&#10;  const heading = document.querySelector(&#39;h1&#39;);&#10;  if (heading) {&#10;    heading.setAttribute(&#39;tabindex&#39;, &#39;-1&#39;);&#10;    heading.focus();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleRouteChange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  document.title </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `新页面标题 - 网站名`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 将焦点移动到 h1，屏幕阅读器自动朗读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> heading</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'h1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (heading) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    heading.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tabindex'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    heading.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">focus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>两种方案对比：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>公告器方案：不改变焦点位置，用户可从当前位置继续操作</li>\n<li>焦点移动方案：明确告知用户「你在新页面了」，但打断了当前操作流</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>框架实现状态（2026）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Next.js：内置路由公告器（<code>&lt;RouteAnnouncer&gt;</code>），自动公告页面标题</li>\n<li>Nuxt：通过 <code>@nuxtjs/a11y</code> 模块提供路由公告</li>\n<li>Angular：<code>RouterModule</code> 的 <code>scrollPositionRestoration</code> 不含无障碍公告，需手动</li>\n<li>SvelteKit：<code>afterNavigate</code> 钩子需手动实现公告</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"动态内容更新的播报策略\">动态内容更新的播报策略</h2><h3 id=\"搜索结果动态更新\">搜索结果动态更新</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;div role=&quot;region&quot; aria-label=&quot;搜索结果&quot; aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;p aria-live=&quot;polite&quot;&gt;找到 42 条相关结果&lt;/p&gt;&#10;  &lt;ul&gt;&#10;    &lt;!-- 动态渲染的结果列表 --&gt;&#10;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"region\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"搜索结果\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"polite\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-atomic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9